        "text": "=Search for \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" on these AEC construction software marketplaces. For each, do ONE search:\n1. \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" site:marketplace.procore.com\n2. \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" site:construction.autodesk.com marketplace\n3. \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" site:app.connect.trimble.com\n4. \"{{ $('Normalize Input').first().json.tool_name }}\" site:marketplace.bluebeam.com\n\nOnly include a marketplace if you find a clear product listing. Limit searches to 4.",
